#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:39
msgid ""
"The paper in inches. If either is zero or less, the default (Letter, 8.5 "
"x 11 inches) is used. All fields at their defaults gave a 612 x 792 pt "
"page above."
msgstr ""
"용지 크기(인치)입니다. 둘 중 하나라도 0 이하이면 기본값(Letter, 8.5 x 11 인치)을 사용합니다. 모든 필드를 "
"기본값으로 두면 위에서 612 x 792 pt 페이지가 나왔습니다."

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:40
msgid "``scale``"
msgstr "``scale``"

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:41
msgid "Zoom of the content; zero or less means 1.0."
msgstr "콘텐츠의 확대율입니다. 0 이하이면 1.0입니다."

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:42
msgid "``prefer_css_page_size``"
msgstr "``prefer_css_page_size``"

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:43
msgid ""
"Use the page size of the CSS ``@page`` rule. Otherwise the content is "
"scaled to fit the paper."
msgstr "CSS ``@page`` 규칙의 페이지 크기를 사용합니다. 그렇지 않으면 콘텐츠를 용지에 맞게 크기를 조정합니다."

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:44
msgid "``margin_type``"
msgstr "``margin_type``"

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:45
msgid ""
"A :class:`~cefweaver.types.PdfPrintMarginType`: ``DEFAULT`` (1 cm), "
"``NONE`` or ``CUSTOM``. ``margin_top``, ``margin_right``, "
"``margin_bottom`` and ``margin_left`` (inches) are used with ``CUSTOM`` "
"only."
msgstr ""
":class:`~cefweaver.types.PdfPrintMarginType` 값이며 ``DEFAULT``\\ (1 cm), "
"``NONE``, ``CUSTOM`` 중 하나입니다. ``margin_top``, ``margin_right``, "
"``margin_bottom``, ``margin_left``\\ (인치)는 ``CUSTOM``\\ 일 때만 사용합니다."

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:46
msgid "``page_ranges``"
msgstr "``page_ranges``"

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:47
msgid ""
"A string such as ``\"1-5, 8, 11-13\"``, **one based**. The pages come in "
"document order. A range past the end is cut to the page count; a range "
"that leaves no page, or one with its start after its end, is an error."
msgstr ""
"``\"1-5, 8, 11-13\"``\\ 과 같은 문자열이며 **1부터 시작합니다**. 페이지는 문서 순서대로 나옵니다. 끝을 "
"넘어선 범위는 페이지 수까지로 잘리며, 남는 페이지가 없는 범위나 시작이 끝보다 뒤인 범위는 오류입니다."

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:48
msgid "``print_background``"
msgstr "``print_background``"

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:49
msgid "Print background colors and images."
msgstr "배경색과 배경 이미지를 인쇄합니다."

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:50
msgid "``display_header_footer``, ``header_template``, ``footer_template``"
msgstr "``display_header_footer``, ``header_template``, ``footer_template``"

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:51
msgid ""
"A header and a footer from HTML templates. The classes ``date``, "
"``title``, ``url``, ``pageNumber`` and ``totalPages`` are replaced by the"
" values."
msgstr ""
"HTML 템플릿으로 만든 머리글과 바닥글입니다. 클래스 ``date``, ``title``, ``url``, "
"``pageNumber``, ``totalPages``\\ 는 해당 값으로 바뀝니다."

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:52
msgid "``generate_tagged_pdf``, ``generate_document_outline``"
msgstr "``generate_tagged_pdf``, ``generate_document_outline``"

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:53
msgid "A tagged (accessible) PDF; a document outline."
msgstr "태그가 있는(접근성을 갖춘) PDF, 문서 개요."

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:55
msgid ""
"Of these, the run above checked the paper size, ``landscape`` and "
"``page_ranges``. The margins, ``scale``, ``prefer_css_page_size``, "
"``print_background`` and the two generate options are described by the "
"docstring only; their effect on the file was not examined."
msgstr ""
"이 중 위 실행에서 확인한 것은 용지 크기, ``landscape``, ``page_ranges``\\ 입니다. 여백, "
"``scale``, ``prefer_css_page_size``, ``print_background``, 그리고 두 generate"
" 옵션은 docstring에만 설명되어 있으며, 파일에 미치는 효과는 확인하지 않았습니다."

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:57
msgid "What the run shows about the behavior:"
msgstr "이 실행으로 알 수 있는 동작은 다음과 같습니다."

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:59
msgid ""
"``page_ranges=\"2\"`` wrote the second page and ``\"2-9\"`` the second "
"and third (the text of the pages was read back with ``pdftotext``). A "
"page number past the end is cut; a range with no page left (``\"9\"``) or"
" with its start after its end (``\"3-1\"``) gives ``ok=False`` and no "
"file."
msgstr ""
"``page_ranges=\"2\"``\\ 는 두 번째 페이지를, ``\"2-9\"``\\ 는 두 번째와 세 번째 페이지를 "
"썼습니다(페이지의 텍스트는 ``pdftotext``\\ 로 다시 읽었습니다). 끝을 넘어선 페이지 번호는 잘립니다. 남는 페이지가 "
"없는 범위(``\"9\"``)나 시작이 끝보다 뒤인 범위(``\"3-1\"``)는 ``ok=False``\\ 를 주고 파일을 만들지"
" 않습니다."

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:60
msgid ""
"``landscape=True`` with the A4 size gave a 841.92 x 595.92 pt page, and "
"the same three blocks of content filled 6 pages instead of 3."
msgstr ""
"A4 크기에서 ``landscape=True``\\ 는 841.92 x 595.92 pt 페이지를 만들었고, 같은 콘텐츠 블록 세 "
"개가 3페이지 대신 6페이지를 채웠습니다."

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:61
msgid "A path in a folder that does not exist gives ``ok=False`` and no file."
msgstr "존재하지 않는 폴더의 경로는 ``ok=False``\\ 를 주고 파일을 만들지 않습니다."

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:62
msgid ""
"The two range errors print one line each on standard error, for example "
"``PrintToPDF failed with error: Page range exceeds page count`` and "
"``PrintToPDF failed with error: Page range is invalid (start > end)``. "
"The missing folder prints nothing."
msgstr ""
"범위 오류 두 가지는 각각 표준 오류에 한 줄씩 출력합니다. 예를 들어 ``PrintToPDF failed with error: "
"Page range exceeds page count``\\ 와 ``PrintToPDF failed with error: Page "
"range is invalid (start > end)``\\ 입니다. 없는 폴더는 아무것도 출력하지 않습니다."

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:63
msgid ""
"The docstring of ``print_to_pdf`` says that on Linux you must implement "
":meth:`~cefweaver.PrintHandler.get_pdf_paper_size`. Here the PDF was "
"written with no print handler at all (above), and a handler that "
"implements ``get_pdf_paper_size`` was never asked in any run of the next "
"section (``get_pdf_paper_size calls: 0``)."
msgstr ""
"``print_to_pdf``\\ 의 docstring은 Linux에서 "
":meth:`~cefweaver.PrintHandler.get_pdf_paper_size`\\ 를 구현해야 한다고 합니다. 여기서는"
" 인쇄 핸들러 없이도 PDF가 만들어졌고(위), ``get_pdf_paper_size``\\ 를 구현한 핸들러도 다음 절의 어떤 "
"실행에서도 호출되지 않았습니다(``get_pdf_paper_size calls: 0``)."

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:64
msgid ""
"``print_to_pdf`` was called after the page had finished loading (the "
"``on_loading`` hook of the view). Calling it earlier was not tried."
msgstr ""
"``print_to_pdf``\\ 는 페이지 로드가 끝난 뒤(뷰의 ``on_loading`` 훅에서) 호출했습니다. 그보다 일찍 "
"호출하는 것은 시험하지 않았습니다."

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:67
msgid "Print with a handler (Linux)"
msgstr "핸들러로 인쇄하기 (Linux)"

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:69
msgid ""
":meth:`~cefweaver.BrowserHost.print` starts a print cycle, and so does "
"``window.print()`` in a page (the docstring of "
":meth:`~cefweaver.PrintHandler.on_print_start` lists ``print()``, "
"``window.print()`` and the print button of the PDF extension; only "
"``print()`` was run here). CEF calls the :class:`~cefweaver.PrintHandler`"
" that :meth:`~cefweaver.Client.get_print_handler` returns:"
msgstr ""
":meth:`~cefweaver.BrowserHost.print`\\ 는 인쇄 사이클을 시작하며, 페이지의 "
"``window.print()``\\ 도 "
"마찬가지입니다(:meth:`~cefweaver.PrintHandler.on_print_start`\\ 의 docstring은 "
"``print()``, ``window.print()``, PDF 확장의 인쇄 버튼을 나열하며, 여기서는 ``print()``\\ "
"만 실행했습니다). CEF는 :meth:`~cefweaver.Client.get_print_handler`\\ 가 반환하는 "
":class:`~cefweaver.PrintHandler`\\ 를 호출합니다."

