#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:80
msgid ""
"With ``get_defaults`` true, fill the :class:`~cefweaver.PrintSettings` "
"with the defaults: device name, DPI, orientation, printable area, copies."
msgstr ""
"``get_defaults``\\ 가 true이면 :class:`~cefweaver.PrintSettings`\\ 를 기본값으로 "
"채웁니다. 기본값은 장치 이름, DPI, 방향, 인쇄 가능 영역, 매수입니다."

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:81
msgid "``on_print_dialog(browser, has_selection, callback)``"
msgstr "``on_print_dialog(browser, has_selection, callback)``"

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:82
msgid ""
"Show a dialog and call ``callback.continue_(settings)`` or "
"``callback.cancel()``, and return ``True``; or return ``False`` to cancel"
" at once."
msgstr ""
"대화상자를 표시하고 ``callback.continue_(settings)``\\ 나 ``callback.cancel()``\\ 을"
" 호출한 뒤 ``True``\\ 를 반환합니다. 또는 ``False``\\ 를 반환하여 즉시 취소합니다."

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:83
msgid "``on_print_job(browser, document_name, pdf_file_path, callback)``"
msgstr "``on_print_job(browser, document_name, pdf_file_path, callback)``"

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:84
msgid ""
"CEF has made the PDF. Copy it or send it to a printer, call "
"``callback.continue_()`` and return ``True``; return ``False`` to cancel "
"the job."
msgstr ""
"CEF가 PDF를 만들었습니다. 이를 복사하거나 프린터로 보내고 ``callback.continue_()``\\ 를 호출한 뒤 "
"``True``\\ 를 반환합니다. 작업을 취소하려면 ``False``\\ 를 반환합니다."

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:85
