msgstr "사이클이 끝났습니다."

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:88
msgid "This script runs the whole cycle without a dialog and without a printer:"
msgstr "이 스크립트는 대화상자도 프린터도 없이 전체 사이클을 실행합니다."

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:93
msgid "Without an argument it prints:"
msgstr "인자 없이 실행하면 다음을 출력합니다."

#: ../../../../../../home/jiho/cef_framework/cefweaver_clone/cefweaver/docs/guide/printing.rst:105
msgid ""
"Three conditions must hold for the cycle to reach ``on_print_job``. Each "
"was taken away in turn (the argument of the script):"
msgstr ""
